# Frontend Environment Configuration

# API base URL
# Development: http://localhost:8787 (Wrangler dev server)
# Production: https://your-domain.workers.dev or https://custom-domain.com
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8787

# Public URL for CDN/assets
# Used to construct photo URLs (e.g., /r2/photos/...)
VITE_PUBLIC_URL=http://localhost:8787
